    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d489-a1">

                <pb facs="1317" n="1311" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1311"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-11"><hi rendition="#italic">April 11,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">The <hi rendition="#small-caps">President</hi>:</p>
                <p>The Secretary of State has the honor to lay before the President copies of
                    dispatches Nos. 43, 44, and 45, all dated March 24 last, from our minister at
                    Honolulu.</p>
                <p>These dispatches are doubtless erroneously numbered, as no No. 42 has reached the
                    Department.</p>
                <p>Respectfully submitted.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
